      "description": "Multiple regional blocs formalize divergent AI governance frameworks, with incompatible standards for safety, openness, and deployment. This institutionalizes a de facto split in the global AI ecosystem, reducing interoperability and increasing friction in cross-border research and incident response. The EU’s isolation deepens as its leverage erodes and no coalition coalesces around its vision.",
